SUMMARY:North Coast Wine and Food Festival 2026
DESCRIPTION:North Coast Wine & Food Festival \nSaturday June 13\, 2026 | Luther Burbank Center | Santa Rosa \nThere is something special about gathering in wine country to celebrate what we grow and create.\nThis premier tasting event features curated bites from leading local chefs paired with Gold Medal wines from distinguished North Coast producers. Guests enjoy an immersive\, walk-around experience designed to showcase innovation\, seasonality\, and regional pride. \nJoin us on Saturday June 13 at Luther Burbank Center for the Arts in Santa Rosa! Stroll from station to station\, meet the people behind the flavors\, and enjoy the vibrant spirit that defines the North Coast culinary scene. \nCome hungry. Leave inspired.
