SUMMARY:"The Bossa Nova Duo\, with Matt Silva and Nick Otis" -- Opening act Equinox
DESCRIPTION:Two dynamic duos deliver timeless classics with style and soul.\nEnjoy a rich and varied afternoon of live music featuring two standout duos. Nick Otis and Matt Silva bring the smooth rhythms of Brazilian bossa nova together with reimagined rock\, jazz\, and soul classics from the ’60s and ’70s. With deep musical roots\, Nick Otis\, son of Johnny Otis and brother of Shuggie Otis\, their sound blends authenticity\, groove\, and effortless charm. \nOpening act is Equinox\, an acoustic duo delivering warm vocals and guitar-driven arrangements of timeless favorites\, spanning classic pop\, rock\, standards\, R&B\, and country western. \nTickets $10 in advance\, $20 at the door. \nDoors open 12:00pm.
