SUMMARY:Comedian Cathy Ladman
DESCRIPTION:The Laugh Cellar presents: Headliner Comedian Cathy Ladman at DeLoach Vineyards \nCathy Ladman is an award-winning stand-up comedian\, writer\, and actress. She has appeared on The Tonight Show 10 times\, with Jimmy Fallon\, Jay Leno\, and Johnny Carson\, including the final two anniversary shows of Johnny Carson’s Tonight Show. She has also appeared six times on The Late Late Show with Craig Ferguson\, had her own HBO One Night Stand special\, a Showtime special\, and numerous other television comedy appearances. In addition\, she was a writer for the hit television shows Roseanne and Caroline in the City. \nComplimentary parking on-site\nOutdoor event\nDoors 6:00pm  / Showtime 7:00pm \nAVAILABLE FOR PURCHASE:\nA beautiful selection of wine and sparkling wine\nOakville Cheese & Charcuterie trays\n21+ Event
