SUMMARY:Pete Sawyer & The Left Hand Monkey Wrench Gang
DESCRIPTION:The Left Hand Monkey Wrench Gang return to The California!\nFiring on all cylinders after a torrid spring that saw them packing venues throughout Northern California\, as well as Hawaii\, Las Vegas and New Orleans\, Pete Sawyer and The Left Hand Monkey Wrench Gang are stoked to be returning to The California Theater in Santa Rosa. Pete and the Gang with be throwing down two fat sets of “all killer–no filler” Grateful Dead Classics\, deep cuts and unexpected gems! \nDoors open at 7:00pm. Show at 8:00pm. \nThis event uses Zoned Seating:\nSeats within each zone are first-come-first-served. Ushers will seat you within your chosen zone upon arrival. (Zone C does not guarantee a seat.)\nCheck ticket descriptions for details\, & scroll down for a general zone chart. \nZONE A: $32.\nZONE B: $26.\nZONE C: $20.\nTickets at the door (Zone C only): $32 \nOur kitchen is open and serving our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of intermission for events with more than 60 pre-sale tickets.
