SUMMARY:Tails & Trails – a fun Walk/Run for Dogwood Animal Rescue
DESCRIPTION:Join your neighbors for a fun Walk/Run benefiting Dogwood Animal Rescue! Bring your dog or a family member for a 1.5-mile trail walk/run in scenic Howarth Park\, Santa Rosa. After crossing the finish line\, celebrate at Dogwood Village\, where everyone can enjoy a variety of snacks\, unique goods/handmade items\, and information dedicated to supporting animal welfare. Plus\, Dogwood dogs to cuddle and a raffle! \nRegister now at: https://ultrasignup.com/register.aspx?did=137912 for this scenic journey through Howarth Park\, while you support a unique\, non-profit animal-rescue organization\, https://dogwoodanimalrescue.org. All registered human participants will receive a custom race T-Shirt and dog participants a bandana. Only $45 to participate with a portion of every race fee supporting Dogwood! The trail is accessible to participants of all levels and canine companions. \nCan’t physically be there? Choose Your Route\, Your Pace. Our *Virtual Participation* option is the perfect way for you and your pup to support Dogwood Animal Rescue from wherever you are. \n“Lace up your shoes\, leash up your pups\, and join us on June 14th\, at 9 am for a day of fun\, fitness\, and fundraising!” For questions\, contact info@WanderingSolesAdventures.com.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/tails-trails-a-fun-walk-run-for-dogwood-animal-rescue/
LOCATION:Howarth Memorial Park\, 630 Summerfield Rd\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
